9-thumbnail.jpg","isNutrition":false,"authors":[{"id":25,"name":{"display":"Gigen Mammoser","first":"Gigen","last":"Mammoser"},"userLogin":"gmammoser","links":{"website":"","facebook":"","linkedin":"","twitter":"","instagram":"","tiktok":""},"link":"/authors/gigen-mammoser","type":{"value":"author","label":"Author"},"nid":"","specialties":[],"guestTitle":"","bio":{"text":"Gigen Mammoser is a freelance writer and journalist based in Los Angeles. He is a graduate of Occidental College and holds an MA in comparative literature from the University of Toronto."},"avatar":{"title":"","src":"","alt":""}}],"reviewedByHeader":"Medically reviewed by","language":"en"},{"title":["FDA Blocks Publication of Vaccine Safety Studies. Why Experts Are Concerned"],"text":["The FDA has blocked the publication of COVID-19 and shingles vaccine safety studies, drawing concern from public health experts."],"link":"/health-news/fda-blocks-publication-covid-shingles-vaccine-safety-studies","imageAlt":"FDA Blocks Publication of Vaccine Safety Studies. Why Experts Are Concerned","thumbnail":"https://media.post.rvohealth.io/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/Vaccine-Safety-GettyImages-2260643489-Thumb.jpg","isNutrition":false,"authors":[{"id":5480,"name":{"display":"Andrea Rice","first":"Andrea","last":"Rice"},"userLogin":"arice","links":{"website":"https://drea.blog/","facebook":"","linkedin":"https://www.linkedin.com/in/andrea-rice-writes/","twitter":"","instagram":"","tiktok":""},"link":"/authors/andrea-rice","type":{"value":"author","label":"Author"},"nid":"","specialties":[],"guestTitle":"","bio":{"text":"\u003cp data-pm-slice=\"1 1 []\"\u003eAndrea Rice is a health and wellness journalist and an editor on Healthline Media’s Global News team. She previously worked at Psych Central, Verywell, Yoga Journal, mindbodygreen, and The New York Times. She is also a yoga and mindfulness teacher and the co-author of “\u003ca class=\"PrimaryLink BaseLink\" href=\"https://www.newharbinger.com/9781684034376/the-yoga-almanac/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eThe Yoga Almanac\u003c/a\u003e.” Connect with her on \u003ca class=\"PrimaryLink BaseLink\" href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/in/andrea-rice-writes\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eLinkedIn\u003c/a\u003e, \u003ca class=\"PrimaryLink BaseLink\" href=\"mailto:arice@healthline.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eemail\u003c/a\u003e her with story tips and pitches, and find her at her \u003ca class=\"PrimaryLink BaseLink\" href=\"https://drea.blog/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003ewebsite\u003c/a\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e\n"},"avatar":{"title":"","width":500,"height":500,"src":"https://post.healthline.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/11/Andrea-Rice-500x500-Bio.png","alt":""}}],"reviewedByHeader":"Medically reviewed by","language":"en"},{"title":["Deadly Hantavirus May Have Spread Among Cruise Ship Passengers, WHO Says"],"text":["A cluster of three deaths and several illnesses has been linked to a deadly hantavirus outbreak on a cruise ship in the Atlantic Ocean. The World…"],"link":"/health-news/hantavirus-outbreak-atlantic-cruise-ship","imageAlt":"Deadly Hantavirus May Have Spread Among Cruise Ship Passengers, WHO Says","thumbnail":"https://media.post.rvohealth.io/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/Hantavirus-Outbreak-GettyImages-2273953428-Thumb.jpg","isNutrition":false,"authors":[{"id":25,"name":{"display":"Gigen Mammoser","first":"Gigen","last":"Mammoser"},"userLogin":"gmammoser","links":{"website":"","facebook":"","linkedin":"","twitter":"","instagram":"","tiktok":""},"link":"/authors/gigen-mammoser","type":{"value":"author","label":"Author"},"nid":"","specialties":[],"guestTitle":"","bio":{"text":"Gigen Mammoser is a freelance writer and journalist based in Los Angeles. He is a graduate of Occidental College and holds an MA in comparative literature from the University of Toronto."},"avatar":{"title":"","src":"","alt":""}}],"reviewedByHeader":"Medically rev