s about the Human Body” and has since dedicated his life to breaking down the complexities and stigmas around the human body and the cultures surrounding it, especially in relation to mental health, sexual health, and gender identity. Follow him on \u003ca href=\"http://TimJewell16\"\u003eTwitter\u003c/a\u003e and \u003ca href=\"https://www.instagram.com/diakritik/\"\u003eInstagram\u003c/a\u003e."},"avatar":{"title":"","width":200,"height":200,"src":"https://post.healthline.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/11/Tim_Jewell_bw.png","alt":""}}],"medicalReviewers":[{"id":114,"name":{"display":"Adithya Cattamanchi, M.D.","first":"Adithya","last":"Cattamanchi, MD"},"userLogin":"acattamanchi","links":{"website":"","facebook":"","linkedin":"https://www.linkedin.com/in/adithyacattamanchi/","twitter":"","instagram":"","tiktok":""},"link":"/reviewers/adithya-cattamanchi-md","type":{"value":"medical_reviewer","label":"Medical Advisor"},"nid":"122507","specialties":[],"guestTitle":"","bio":{"text":"Dr. Adithya Cattamanchi is an \u003ca href=\"https://www.abms.org/board-certification/\"\u003eABMS board certified\u003c/a\u003e pulmonologist who also specializes in critical care medicine. He currently practices at UCI Health and is a professor of medicine at University of California Irvine.\r\n\r\n\u003cstrong\u003eEducation\u003c/strong\u003e\r\n\u003cul\u003e\r\n \t\u003cli\u003eDuke University, BA\u003c/li\u003e\r\n \t\u003cli\u003eUniversity of California, San Francisco School of Medicine, MD, MAS\u003c/li\u003e\r\n\u003c/ul\u003e\r\n\u003cstrong\u003eCertifications\u003c/strong\u003e\r\n\u003cul\u003e\r\n \t\u003cli\u003eAmerican Board of Internal Medicine - Pulmonary Medicine\u003c/li\u003e\r\n \t\u003cli\u003eAmerican Board of Internal Medicine - Critical Care\u003c/li\u003e\r\n\u003c/ul\u003e\r\n\u003cstrong\u003eProfessional Accomplishments\u003c/strong\u003e\r\n\u003cul\u003e\r\n \t\u003cli\u003eResearched the epidemiology and management of tuberculosis in high burden countries\u003c/li\u003e\r\n \t\u003cli\u003ePublished over 150 articles related to tuberculosis and other lung diseases in peer-reviewed medical journals\u003c/li\u003e\r\n\u003c/ul\u003e\r\n\u003cstrong\u003eAffiliations\u003c/strong\u003e\r\n\u003cul\u003e\r\n \t\u003cli\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://www.thoracic.org/\"\u003eAmerican Thoracic Society (ATS)\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\r\n \t\u003cli\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://theunion.org/\"\u003eInternational Union Against Tuberculosis and Lung Disease\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\r\n\u003c/ul\u003e"},"avatar":{"title":"","width":500,"height":500,"src":"https://post.healthline.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/01/Adithya-Cattamanchi-500x500-Bio.png","alt":""}}],"id":"wp-651099","updateReason":[],"factCheckedBy":"","factCheckers":[],"articleHistory":[],"articleDates":{"factChecked":{"date":null,"display":""},"medicallyReviewed":{"date":1512115200,"display":"December 1, 2017"},"published":{"date":1512115200,"display":"December 1, 2017"},"lastUpdates":{"date":1537245471,"display":"September 18, 2018"},"modified":{"date":1537270671,"display":"September 18, 2018"}},"type":"healthfeature","language":"en"},"cesData":{"metaDescription":"A sucking chest wound is serious and, without prompt treatment, may be fatal.","title":"Sucking Chest Wound: First Aid, Treatment, and Recovery","iab_tag_tier_1":["300"],"iab_tag_tier_2":["300"],"mpdTags":[{"confidence":0.9043133415876209,"type":"topic_level_1","value":"health"},{"confidence":0.820710960062712,"type":"topic_level_2","value":"physical_conditions"},{"confidence":0.09449560181578197,"type":"topic_level_3","value":"skin_conditions"},{"confidence":0.3172539376946021,"type":"topic_level_4","value":"skin_injuries"},{"confidence":0.5257018800861077,"type":"entity","value":"wound"}]},"careJourney":{"engagementVideoJSON":[{"toolName":"Heart Health, Breast Cancer","videoID":"LPJ86BzTvko","articleURL":"https://www.healthline.com/health/best-exercises-for-high-blood-pressure"},{"toolName":"Heart Heal